; near each zone's entry X (see the "ZONE N:" comment markers above for reference X's).
; Zones 1-3: warm sodium + cyan accent. Zones 4-6: magenta/cyan (Neon District identity).
; Zones 7-9: cold white/blue (Corporate High-Rise identity). Zone 10: beat-animated
; stage lighting (stage_light.gd).
